---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Chekpoint" variant="centered">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Chekpoint</a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="effective-date">Effective: January 1, 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly when you create an account, write reviews, or contact us. This includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email address and username (required for account creation)</li>
          <li>Profile information such as bio, avatar, and banner image (optional)</li>
          <li>Reviews, ratings, and other content you post</li>
          <li>Messages you send through our contact form</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We also collect limited technical information automatically, such as your browser type and IP address, for security and analytics purposes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Operate and maintain the Service</li>
          <li>Display your profile and reviews to other users</li>
          <li>Send transactional emails (e.g. password resets)</li>
          <li>Respond to your support inquiries</li>
          <li>Detect and prevent fraud or abuse</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Information Sharing</h2>
        <p>Your username, profile, and reviews are public by default and visible to all visitors of the Service. We may share your information with third-party service providers who help us operate the Service (such as our hosting and authentication providers), subject to confidentiality obligations.</p>
        <p>We may disclose your information if required by law or to protect the rights, property, or safety of Chekpoint or others.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <p>Your data is stored using Supabase, a secure cloud database provider. We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>We use session cookies solely to maintain your authenticated state. We do not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or third-party analytics that identify you personally.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Game data and cover images are provided by IGDB (Internet Game Database). By using the Service, you also interact with IGDB's data under their terms. Our Service uses Google Fonts for typography; Google may collect limited data per their privacy policy.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may update or correct your profile information at any time from your profile page. You may request deletion of your account and associated personal data by contacting us. We will process deletion requests within a reasonable time.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>The Service is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we learn we have collected such information, we will delete it promptly.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will note the effective date at the top of this page. Continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions or requests regarding your privacy, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .effective-date {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .legal-body {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }

  h2 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  p, li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  a { color: var(--accent); }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-body { padding: 24px 20px; }
    h1 { font-size: 26px; }
  }
</style>
